{"unit_id":"Ultroncn__dsh-archived-chats#card-zh","repo":"Ultroncn/dsh-archived-chats","commit":"76721bdb4e24db6e469505db991ba1756fb68a93","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Archive Management（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 提供集中管理会话归档的设置界面，并通过 Host 的工作区注册表和会话持久层读取、更新归档状态。用户可按工作区浏览已归档与未归档会话，搜索标题、标签、备注和对话内容，打开只读对话预览，维护标签与备注，并将归档导出或从 ZIP 备份导入。插件还提供工作区批量归档、来源与分支查看、统计，以及对旧回收记录的恢复入口。适合需要整理大量 DSH 对话、查找旧内容或迁移归档备份的用户。无需 API Key 或外部账户；插件将元数据及恢复数据保存在本地 DSH 数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1162","lib/index.js:1439","lib/index.js:2007","lib/client.js:1"]}
{"unit_id":"Ultroncn__dsh-archived-chats#card-en","repo":"Ultroncn/dsh-archived-chats","commit":"76721bdb4e24db6e469505db991ba1756fb68a93","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Archive Management organizes DSH web chat archives. Browse by workspace, search messages and metadata, preview chats, edit tags and notes, and export or import ZIP backups. It also offers bulk archiving and lineage views. No API key is needed; plugin data stays in the local DSH data directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1162","lib/index.js:1439","lib/index.js:2007","lib/client.js:1"]}
